// Test check with alias variables in parens check(var): or check @var:

"--- Test 1: check(score): ---" >> Display.
85 >> check(score):
    is >= 90: $"Excellent: {score}" >> Display.
    is >= 70: $"Good: {score}" >> Display.
    else:     $"Failed: {score}" >> Display.
..

"--- Test 2: check(x) inline inside Map ---" >> Display.
[10, 50, 100] >> Map @val:
    @val >> check(x):
        is >= 50: $"Pass: {x}" >> Return.
        else:     $"Fail: {x}" >> Return.
    .. >> Return.
.. >> Display.

"--- Test 3: check @val: ---" >> Display.
"hello" >> check @val:
    is "hello": $"Matched string: {@val}" >> Display.
    else:       "Not matched" >> Display.
..
